---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | iRacional">
  <Navbar />

  <main class="bg-slate-50">
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-amber-600">About us</p>
        <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">A trusted pet essentials brand built on quality, care, and dependable service.</h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">iRacional is a modern pet retail brand focused on providing thoughtfully selected products that support the everyday needs of pets and their caregivers. Our goal is to create a reliable and welcoming shopping experience that combines premium quality with practical value.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pb-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Our mission</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">To make pet care simpler, safer, and more enjoyable through high-quality products and a customer-first experience.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Our standards</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">We carefully choose products that meet practical needs, support animal wellbeing, and align with responsible retail practices.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Our promise</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">We are committed to transparent service, secure transactions, and clear communication at every stage of the customer journey.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pb-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-slate-900 p-8 text-white shadow-xl lg:p-12">
        <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] lg:items-start">
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-amber-400">Company information</p>
            <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold">Operating with professionalism, compliance, and care.</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">Our business operations are guided by established procedures, clear policies, and a commitment to responsible service. We continue to refine our practices as the company grows and evolves.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] bg-white/10 p-6 backdrop-blur">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Business practice</h3>
            <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300">
              <li>• Customer support handled through verified communication channels</li>
              <li>• Orders processed according to documented procedures</li>
              <li>• Returns and refunds managed in line with stated policies</li>
              <li>• Data and privacy practices reviewed regularly</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pb-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Legal and operational note</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-8">This page is intended as a professional placeholder for your business information. Please review and replace the content with your official company details, registered business name, address, contact information, and any required legal disclosures before publishing publicly.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
